        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Guang bam the guang dailiang mei pu,",
            "Kamei kum mei mak kandi khou",
            "Nzaeng mei guang e dailiang mei ;",
            "Thuan no,thuan no , hosanna dailiang mei ta.",
            "",
            "Thuan no guang dailiang mei pu ta,",
            "Thuan no halleluijah",
            "Guang guaina guang poubaomei ta",
            "Thuan no, thuan no, hosana guang dailiang mei ta.",
            "",
            "2. Zaat kapum ma rui thuan kudiu,",
            "Khouringc khounah kapumc na ni,",
            "Kaniu thaimei lu rui thuanc diw",
            "Thuanc no, thuanc no, hosana guang daimei ta.",
            "",
            "3. Katik kahim daimei swdiu",
            "Lung gailiang mei guang hosanna",
            "Neila thao na zaat guai na rui",
            "Thuanc no, thuanc no , hosana guang daimei ta."
          ]
        }
      }
